# Do not add negated (!) patterns here. With unreadable runtime directories,
# BuildKit may traverse excluded data to search for re-included descendants.
# Keep Runner docs/tests/fixtures: its build-time identity and drift checks need
# selected files there. Including these inputs avoids fragile re-inclusion rules.
